              "key": "condition",
              "html": "<p>В тре­уголь­ни­ке <var data-math-identifier=\"ABC\">ABC</var> <img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"b1d8b726-29ef-4d29-80b9-eba3cdd92cf2\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/b1d8b726-29ef-4d29-80b9-eba3cdd92cf2\"/><span data-inline-latex=\"AC=BC\"></span>, <var data-math-identifier=\"AD\">AD</var>  — вы­со­та, угол <var data-math-identifier=\"BAD\">BAD</var> равен <span data-inline-latex=\"34^{\\circ}\"></span>. Най­ди­те угол <var data-math-identifier=\"C\">C</var>. Ответ дайте в гра­ду­сах.</p>",
