              "asset_keys": [
                "image_1"
              ],
              "section_id": "condition:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "key": "solution",
              "html": "<p>Так как <span data-inline-latex=\"AD\"></span> — высота, <span data-inline-latex=\"\\triangle ABD\"></span> прямоугольный. Поэтому</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"\\angle B=90^{\\circ}-\\angle BAD=90^{\\circ}-34^{\\circ}=56^{\\circ}\"></span>.</p></center><p>В равнобедренном <span data-inline-latex=\"\\triangle ABC\"></span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\angle A=\\angle B\"></span>, следовательно,</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"\\angle C=180^{\\circ}-2\\angle B=180^{\\circ}-2\\cdot 56^{\\circ}=68^{\\circ}\"></span>.</p></center>",
              "title": "Решение",
              "asset_keys": [],
              "section_id": "solution:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            },
